  "content": "<hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>歡迎來到死神工藝</strong></h1><p>這是一個死神工藝模組包，添加了優質功能並提供更好的遊戲體驗</p><hr><h2><strong>系統需求</strong></h2><p>客戶端&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;伺服器端</p><p>6GB 記憶體&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;6GB 記憶體</p><p>第7代 i5 處理器&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第7代 i5 處理器</p><p>4GB 記憶體亦可運作</p><hr><h2><strong>多人遊戲</strong></h2><p>若無需自行架設伺服器進行多人遊戲，請使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/essential-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Essential Mod</a></p><p><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HhL7E8-fcGQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>1. 開啟區域網路</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/968909/description_2e9b0a44-8bc9-4779-bcd5-a58e53e8cc04.png\"></p>\n<p>2. 聊天視窗中應會出現以下訊息</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/968909/description_36024ac8-4b6c-4217-a1a1-6d9435e135c9.png\"></p>\n<p>3. 在直接連線輸入框中貼上網域並連接</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/968909/description_f5080941-38d7-48e4-8462-8dd882502ea9.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2><strong>特色功能</strong></h2><p>此模組包包含以下特色：</p><ul>\n<li>死神模組</li>\n<li>家具系統</li>\n<li>大量新生態域</li>\n<li>自動化科技</li>\n<li>改良版圖形介面</li>\n<li>小型品質優化功能</li>\n<li>效能提升</li>\n</ul><p>還有更多內容...</p>",
